%% Data flow for Workbench scan -> confirm loop
sequenceDiagram
    participant AdminMenu as WordPress Admin Page
    participant SPA as WorkbenchPage (React)
    participant REST as GET /acx/v1/workbench/media
    participant DB as WP_Query attachments

    AdminMenu->>SPA: Render #alt-context-admin-app
    SPA->>SPA: Determine initial route (page param/hash)
    loop Scan tab
        SPA->>REST: fetchMedia(page, per_page, search,\nX-WP-Nonce)
        REST->>DB: query attachments (missing alt text)
        DB-->>REST: items,total,totalPages
        REST-->>SPA: JSON payload
        SPA->>SPA: render MediaSelection + selection state
    end
    SPA->>SPA: Scan tab runs Scan Faces on the selected media
    SPA->>SPA: Confirm tab lists clustering results / next steps
